        {
          "id": "l13",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "The Bajau spleen was about fifty percent *bigger*, roughly the size of a tennis ball.",
          "pauseAfterMs": 500
        },
        {
          "id": "l14",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "It was big even in Bajau who do not dive, so it is in their *genes*.",
